invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_lanes.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-vector
reason: the NEON split for the layers of span 2 takes the odd pairs
  into lo as well as into hi, so half the coefficients drop out of the
  butterflies and the other half run twice. Only an arm64 compiler reads
  the line, so the script builds bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test for arm64
  and runs it under qemu-aarch64. The lane skips without docker, and
  this then reports unguarded rather than caught.

--- old
    *lo = vreinterpretq_s16_s32(vuzp1q_s32(a32, b32));
--- new
    *lo = vreinterpretq_s16_s32(vuzp2q_s32(a32, b32));
